  "fullDescription": "<p>Printable Garden Journal. Inspirational Bullet pages. This kit comes complete with 6 feature pages and 5 journaling pages. These make a 22 page signature when folded in half. We have also included 4 ephemera and decoupage sheets that makes pockets, decoupage tag, envelope, tags etc. Each printable sheet is A4 (Letter Size) and saved as high resolution 300dpi so they print off really clearly from your home computer. We have provided the sheets in both JPEG and PDF format. We jhave also provided the ephemera as PNG files just in case you want to use them with your cutting machines or incorporate them into your own designs.</p>",
